PASS Viewport Create records the original surface hit
PASS Save places a single Quake III misc_model at the captured surface
PASS The model bundle includes source, textures and frame groups
PASS Repeat Save updates the same entity and preserves its transform
PASS Map Undo restores the previous immutable model
PASS Map Redo restores the new model
PASS The placed character entity can be deleted
PASS Save cannot recreate a deleted character entity
PASS Reopening the map retains the asset and clears the old document binding
PASS Character preview survives switching between docked and integrated panes
PASS Toolbar Compile stages the entire character bundle and opens the BSP
